Subject: [PATCH 082/144] GreatDANE Explore: weekly sparse sample + global
 probe budget (path A)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Product decisions (nowon via coordinator): reject central checker;
browser-side HTTPS through normal Dane TLS/TLSA only. Cadence ≤1
check/site/7d, hard global budget 8 probes/week, sample≤8, directory
page cap (never enumerate the full name list), min 24h between rounds,
display TTL 14d (hide expired/failed; no on-demand probe). New-tab
reads cache only; no Places writes; no probe-to-fill tiles.
